Convert Samsung S5P HDMI CEC adapter bindings to DT schema.

Signed-off-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@linaro.org>
---
 .../bindings/media/cec/samsung,s5p-cec.yaml   | 66 +++++++++++++++++++
